[
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "Welcome to KC Desk Notes. Today we\nare unpacking one fresh research\nreport and the question it raises.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 5.991,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "KC Desk Notes",
      "research report"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "Welcome back to the podcast. Today\nwe’re talking about a new concept\nthat’s generating a lot of buzz in\nChina’s semiconductor space.",
    "start": 6.351,
    "end": 13.549,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "podcast",
      "new concept"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "It’s called the Tau Scaling Law,\nand some are calling it another\nDeepSeek moment. So what exactly\nis it?",
    "start": 13.909,
    "end": 19.946,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "Tau Scaling Law",
      "DeepSeek moment"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "Great question. The Tau Law,\nproposed by Huawei at a recent\nconference, is essentially a new\nroadmap for improving chip",
    "start": 20.306,
    "end": 23.975,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "Tau Law",
      "Huawei",
      "conference"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "performance.",
    "start": 23.975,
    "end": 27.644,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "Tau Law",
      "Huawei",
      "conference"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "Instead of focusing on making\ntransistors smaller, which is what\nMoore’s Law did, it focuses on\nreducing signal latency across the",
    "start": 28.004,
    "end": 31.719,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "transistors smaller",
      "signal latency",
      "chip stack"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "entire chip stack.",
    "start": 31.719,
    "end": 35.434,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "transistors smaller",
      "signal latency",
      "chip stack"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "Think of it as a shift from\ngeometric scaling to temporal\nscaling.",
    "start": 35.794,
    "end": 39.416,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "geometric scaling",
      "temporal scaling"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "Temporal scaling. That sounds like\na big conceptual shift. Why is\nthis important right now?",
    "start": 39.776,
    "end": 44.049,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "Temporal scaling",
      "conceptual shift"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "It’s important because it offers a\npath forward for China’s\nsemiconductor industry,",
    "start": 44.409,
    "end": 48.588,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "path forward"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "which faces export controls that\nlimit access to extreme\nultraviolet lithography, or EUV.\nThe Tau Law provides a clear,",
    "start": 48.948,
    "end": 56.332,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "export controls",
      "extreme ultraviolet lithography",
      "EUV"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "predictable roadmap for continuous\nimprovement without relying on the\nmost advanced manufacturing tools.",
    "start": 56.692,
    "end": 62.172,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "predictable roadmap",
      "continuous improvement",
      "advanced manufacturing tools"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "So it’s a workaround of sorts. But\nhow does it actually work in\npractice? What are the key\ninnovations?",
    "start": 62.532,
    "end": 67.734,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "workaround",
      "key innovations"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "One of the most interesting\ninnovations is something called\nLogicFolding. At first glance, it\nlooks similar to TSMC’s SoIC",
    "start": 68.094,
    "end": 71.762,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "LogicFolding"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "technology,",
    "start": 71.762,
    "end": 75.431,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "LogicFolding"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "where you stack two dies on top of\neach other. But Huawei’s approach\nis different. They’ve achieved a\nsub-2 micron bonding pitch,",
    "start": 75.791,
    "end": 82.432,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "sub-2 micron bonding pitch"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "which allows them to stack logic\non top of logic at the cell level,\nnot just at the chip level. This\nreduces latency and improves both",
    "start": 82.792,
    "end": 87.412,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "latency",
      "density",
      "frequency"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "density and frequency.",
    "start": 87.412,
    "end": 92.033,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "latency",
      "density",
      "frequency"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "So they’re not just stacking\nchips, they’re stacking individual\ncircuit blocks. That’s a much\nfiner level of integration. What",
    "start": 92.393,
    "end": 96.874,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "stacking chips",
      "circuit blocks",
      "integration"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "does that mean for performance?",
    "start": 96.874,
    "end": 101.356,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "stacking chips",
      "circuit blocks",
      "integration"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "It means significant gains. For\nexample,",
    "start": 101.716,
    "end": 103.992,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "significant gains"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "they project a jump in transistor\ndensity from 155 million\ntransistors per square millimeter\nin 2025 to 238 million in 2026.",
    "start": 104.352,
    "end": 112.525,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "transistor density",
      "155 million",
      "238 million"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "That’s equivalent to TSMC’s N3\nnode density, even though they’re\nusing older manufacturing nodes.\nAnd they’re targeting 400 plus by",
    "start": 112.885,
    "end": 117.32,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "older manufacturing nodes",
      "400 plus",
      "2031"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "2031.",
    "start": 117.32,
    "end": 121.755,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "older manufacturing nodes",
      "400 plus",
      "2031"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "That’s impressive on paper. But\nwhat about the bigger picture? How\ndoes this scale to AI clusters?",
    "start": 122.115,
    "end": 126.759,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "AI clusters"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "That’s where the system-level\nimprovements come in. They’re also\nworking on near-packaged optical\nI/O, called Hi-ONE, and a unified",
    "start": 127.119,
    "end": 130.928,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "near-packaged optical I/O",
      "Hi-ONE",
      "unified bus network"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "bus network.",
    "start": 130.928,
    "end": 134.736,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "near-packaged optical I/O",
      "Hi-ONE",
      "unified bus network"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "These technologies aim to reduce\ncommunication latency between\nchips from tens of microseconds to\nabout 100 nanoseconds.",
    "start": 135.096,
    "end": 140.9,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "communication latency",
      "tens of microseconds",
      "100 nanoseconds"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "They’re targeting a 125 times\nimprovement in compute power at\nthe superpod level over the next\nfive years.",
    "start": 141.26,
    "end": 148.691,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "125 times improvement",
      "compute power",
      "superpod"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "So the Tau Law is not just about\nthe chip itself, but the entire\nsystem around it. But there must\nbe some constraints. This can’t be",
    "start": 149.051,
    "end": 153.649,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "Tau Law",
      "chip",
      "system"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "a magic bullet, right?",
    "start": 153.649,
    "end": 158.246,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "Tau Law",
      "chip",
      "system"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "Absolutely. There are several\nchallenges. First, it relies\nheavily on advanced 3DIC\npackaging, where global leaders",
    "start": 158.606,
    "end": 162.925,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "challenges",
      "3DIC packaging",
      "TSMC"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "like TSMC still hold a significant\nlead.",
    "start": 162.925,
    "end": 167.244,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "challenges",
      "3DIC packaging",
      "TSMC"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "Second, stacking more dies\nincreases power density, which\ncreates thermal issues that need\ninnovative power delivery",
    "start": 167.604,
    "end": 171.714,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "power density",
      "thermal issues",
      "power delivery solutions"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "solutions. And third,",
    "start": 171.714,
    "end": 175.824,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "power density",
      "thermal issues",
      "power delivery solutions"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "yield and cost will be major\nbarriers if not managed carefully.",
    "start": 176.184,
    "end": 179.295,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "yield",
      "cost",
      "barriers"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "So it’s a promising roadmap, but\nit doesn’t mean China will close\nthe gap overnight. What does this\nmean for investors?",
    "start": 179.655,
    "end": 185.692,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "promising roadmap",
      "gap",
      "investors"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "The report sees it as structurally\npositive for the entire China\nsemiconductor ecosystem. Key\nbeneficiaries include foundries",
    "start": 186.052,
    "end": 189.674,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "structurally positive",
      "China semiconductor ecosystem",
      "foundries"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "like SMIC,",
    "start": 189.674,
    "end": 193.297,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "structurally positive",
      "China semiconductor ecosystem",
      "foundries"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "which will be critical for\nmanufacturing these advanced logic\nand packaging solutions. Also,\ndomestic tool vendors like NAURA",
    "start": 193.657,
    "end": 197.442,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "domestic tool vendors",
      "NAURA",
      "Piotech"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "and Piotech,",
    "start": 197.442,
    "end": 201.227,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "domestic tool vendors",
      "NAURA",
      "Piotech"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "which provide equipment for\nadvanced logic fabrication and\nbonding tools.",
    "start": 201.587,
    "end": 205.813,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "provide",
      "equipment"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "So the Tau Law is essentially a\nnew framework for the industry to\nrally around. But there are still\nopen questions.",
    "start": 206.173,
    "end": 212.814,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "open questions"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "What does the report leave\nunsolved that makes the full\nanalysis worth reading?",
    "start": 213.174,
    "end": 217.075,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "report",
      "full analysis"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "One key question is how fast\nHuawei can solve the thermal and\nyield challenges. Another is\nwhether this roadmap can truly",
    "start": 217.435,
    "end": 221.127,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "thermal",
      "yield challenges",
      "roadmap"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "narrow the gap with global\nleaders,",
    "start": 221.127,
    "end": 224.819,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "thermal",
      "yield challenges",
      "roadmap"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "or if it will just keep China in a\nparallel track. The report goes\ninto much more detail on the\ntrade-offs and the specific",
    "start": 225.179,
    "end": 229.242,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "trade-offs",
      "specific companies",
      "best positioned"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "companies that are best\npositioned.",
    "start": 229.242,
    "end": 233.305,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "trade-offs",
      "specific companies",
      "best positioned"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "Sounds like there’s plenty more to\ndig into. For anyone who wants the\nfull picture, the Bernstein report\nis a great resource. Thanks for",
    "start": 233.665,
    "end": 237.914,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "Bernstein report",
      "resource"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "breaking it down.",
    "start": 237.914,
    "end": 242.164,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "Bernstein report",
      "resource"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "My pleasure. There’s a lot to\nwatch in this space, and the Tau\nLaw is definitely a development\nworth following.",
    "start": 242.524,
